12
00:02:25,820 --> 00:02:35,890
All right, so every year when I teach

13
00:02:35,890 --> 00:02:43,910
the perfectionism lecture, something happened. So the first year I remember, I actually forgot my computer at home.

14
00:02:45,010 --> 00:02:48,610
Second time, the projector didn't work.

15
00:02:50,270 --> 00:02:52,250
And this year I forgot my power,

16
